audi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can LED screens be rented for a single event?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes \\u2014 rental-spec panels with fast-lock frames rig in hours and hire from roughly AED 150\\u2013400 per m\\u00b2 per day depending on duration and pitch.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What refresh rate do event screens need for filming?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"3840Hz minimum so broadcast and phone cameras see no scan lines \\u2014 essential for concerts, conferences and weddings that will be filmed.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do you provide on-site operators for events?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes \\u2014 our event crews handle rigging, signal, live switching and de-rigging, with backup processing on standby for show-critical moments.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Solutions\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/solutions\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Solutions \\u2014 Events\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/solutions/events\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Solutions — Events</h1><p>Solutions — Events. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><h2>Events &amp; Exhibitions LED — FAQs</h2><h3>Can LED screens be rented for a single event?</h3><p>Yes — rental-spec panels with fast-lock frames rig in hours and hire from roughly AED 150–400 per m² per day depending on duration and pitch.</p><h3>What refresh rate do event screens need for filming?</h3><p>3840Hz minimum so broadcast and phone cameras see no scan lines — essential for concerts, conferences and weddings that will be filmed.</p><h3>Do you provide on-site operators for events?</h3><p>Yes — our event crews handle rigging, signal, liv